# Normalize to LF in the repository and on checkout, regardless of each
# contributor's core.autocrlf setting. Keeps diffs clean across Windows/macOS/Linux
# and matches end_of_line = lf in .editorconfig.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never munge these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp4 binary

# Generated — collapse in diffs and exclude from language stats.
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated
